{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109478","id":2733170978,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i6OEi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109478","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109478.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109478.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109478","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109478/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109478/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109478/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d4b7222ca0125af74384bdd12c707e9db0e7c9cf","number":109478,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix screen_orientation not being assigned on ios","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes issue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107231\r\n\r\nIntroduced by commit: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/2d93e004b9b5f6d9f7a56bb43baae0cb1de27443\r\n\r\nHere is a link to the file diff: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/2d93e004b9b5f6d9f7a56bb43baae0cb1de27443#diff-02e997eae7e3917de38375685775ae983ff69c3776158596f36058d7771ae3b4R658\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1541\" height=\"306\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6d97fef-f8ae-4ef7-acff-bfbcc4657240\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAs you can see, @bruvzg accidentally deleted the assignment when the error check was added:\r\n\r\n```mm\r\nscreen_orientation = p_orientation;\r\n```\r\n\r\nHence, it never rotates when the device rotates!  In fact, iOS shouldn't respect any setting and is likely landscape only at the moment.  Which means vertical orientation is likely also broken.  This should be a blocker on the 4.5 release imo.\r\n\r\nAs always, thanks for the awesome engine and let me know if you need any changes to the PR.  Much love from Lange Studios (and me personally)! :)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","desc